            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a patient with previous transient left ventricular apical balloonig three months ago, who had got a new chest ischemic-like pain associated to an important dynamic left ventricular intracavitary obstruction which disappeared after betablockers treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
